stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> idle
    idle --> waiting: not-ready answer
    waiting --> polling: NEXT ends, refetch
    state polling {
        asking
    }
    polling --> idle: answer ready
    polling --> waiting: answer not ready
    polling --> failed: refetch fails
    waiting --> gaveUp: NEXT ends after 5 min
    failed --> waiting: new not-ready answer
    gaveUp --> waiting: new not-ready answer
